{"parse":{"title":"Redemption Code","pageid":15440,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"custom-tabs-default custom-tabs\"><span class=\"active-tab\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Overview</strong></span><span class=\"inactive-tab\"><a href=\"/wiki/Redemption_Code/History\" title=\"Redemption Code/History\">History</a></span></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Redemption Code</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Game_Systems\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Game Systems\">Game Systems</a></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Redemption codes</b> are released as part of events, milestones, or other promotions. They can be redeemed for in-game items.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>Codes can be redeemed in two ways:\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Website:</b> Through the official <b>Zenless Zone Zero</b> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://zenless.hoyoverse.com/redemption\">Redeem code</a> page. (For Global servers)</li>\n<li><b>In-Game:</b> Through the Menu ➤ Go to More <span class=\"zzw-icon\" title=\"More\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"More\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/zenless-zone-zero/images/5/56/Icon_More.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20240602231252\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon More.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_More.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></span> ➤ Redemption Code <span class=\"zzw-icon\" title=\"Redemption Code\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Redemption Code\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/zenless-zone-zero/images/7/7b/Icon_Redemption_Code.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20240728114226\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Redemption Code.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Redemption_Code.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<p>Additionally, the following requirements must be met:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Reach <a href=\"/wiki/Inter-Knot_Level\" title=\"Inter-Knot Level\">Inter-Knot Level</a> 5 to unlock.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"All_Codes\">All Codes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fzenless-zone-zero.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FRedemption_Code%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All times listed below are according to UTC. Also note that \"indefinite\" does not mean \"infinite\"; a code can become unredeemable if it hits its max usage limit or if HoYoverse decides to revoke it.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-customtoggle-nochromes wds-button\" style=\"margin:5px 5px -10px 0px;\">Toggle Only Polychromes</div><table class=\"wikitable sortable tdl3 tdl4\"><tbody><tr><th>Code</th><th>Server</th><th style=\"width: 250px;\">Rewards</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td><b><code style=\"user-select: all;\">ZZZVOID32</code></b><br /><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\